
Edit CircuitSimulator.desktop in this folder.

Set the proper path to Circuit Simulator folder.

Then you can copy it to your desktop or any other place to lauch Circuit Simulator.

To allow opening circuits from your file manager put circuitsimulator-mime.xml file into
~/.local/share/mime/packages/ folder and then launch

update-mime-database ~/.local/share/mime/

in your command line.
